# Baseline .gitignore for the State A snapshot.
#
# The upstream tree has one of its own; it is not in the tarball, because a
# snapshot that carried VCS files would let a submission read upstream intent out
# of them.  This replaces it with the same idea reduced to what a trial container
# actually produces: build output, editor droppings, and the artifacts a run of
# the server leaves behind.
#
# Nothing here is graded.  It exists so `git status` in /workspace/repo answers
# "what have I changed" rather than listing a few thousand class files.

# Maven output
target/
*.class

# Server run products.  A GraphHopper run writes a graph cache next to the
# config and rotates its logs; neither is source.
graph-cache/
*-gh/
*.osm.pbf
*.osm.gz
*.osm.xml
logs/
*.log
*.log.gz

# JVM crash and profiling output
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
*.hprof

# Editors and OS
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.settings/
.classpath
.project
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
